  "description": "The Redmine deployment will run on a PostgreSQL database (the \u201cpostgresql\u201d option is selected), with the PostgreSQL service enabled and allotted a persistent volume of\u202f20\u202fGiB. Although a MariaDB configuration exists, it is disabled; its master node is set to use a 5\u202fGiB volume should it ever be activated.  \n\nIngress is fully enabled and protected with TLS. The system will use cert\u2011manager to generate the TLS certificate automatically, and the application will be reachable at **redmine.example.com**. Persistent storage for the Redmine pods is also enabled, providing a 10\u202fGiB volume. The administrative account uses the email **admin@example.com**, username **admin**, and password **A1b2C3d4E5**."
